  @api cm:isDeclared(key)  @ 478
      @contract  non-raising existence test against the schema; true iff key is declared  @ 477
  @api cm:get(key, opts)  @ 482-486
      @contract  deep-copy of resolved value (most-specific tier, else default); raises on unknown key  @ 480
      @contract  opts.mergeTiers=true → per-subkey union across defaults+tiers; table-valued keys only  @ 481
  @api cm:getAt(level, key)  @ 489-498
      @contract  reads single tier only (no merge, no defaults); key nil → whole-cache clone  @ 488
  @api cm:valueFor(handle, scope, key)  @ 501-508
      @contract  single-tier value for a foreign take/track handle (ps:getAt); no merge or defaults  @ 500
  @api cm:defaultFor(key)  @ 511-514
      @contract  deep-copy of the schema default for key (no tiers, no merge); raises on unknown key  @ 510
  -- Writing
  @api cm:set(level, key, value)  @ 519-529
      @contract  deep-copies value into tier cache, persists, fires targeted configChanged  @ 518
  @api cm:remove(level, key)  @ 532-543
      @contract  removes key from named tier; no-op (no signal) if that tier's cache is unloaded  @ 531
  @api cm:assign(level, updates)  @ 546-560
      @contract  validates all keys before any write (all-or-nothing); REMOVE deletes; fires signal  @ 545

